---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Nearly in | Why Not Now?"
  description="One more step: check your inbox and confirm your subscription."
>
  <section class="section section--painted" style="min-height:60vh; display:grid; align-items:center">
    <div class="wrap center">
      <h1 class="display display--hero outlined">Nearly in.</h1>
      <p class="chip-line" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem"><span class="script paint-chip">Check your inbox and click confirm. That's it.</span></p>
      <p style="max-width:44ch; margin:0 auto 1.5rem; font-weight:600">Nothing there? Give it a minute, then check spam. The email comes from Why Not Now.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--red" href="/">Back to the show</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
